WEBVTT

00:03:26.076 --> 00:03:31.116
the X industry has done
a better job of cleaning up BP’s image

00:03:31.116 --> 00:03:34.076
than BP has yet done cleaning up
the Gulf of Mexico.

00:03:34.076 --> 00:03:35.076
(Applause)

00:03:35.956 --> 00:03:36.956
Thank you.

00:03:36.956 --> 00:03:37.956
(Applause)

00:03:38.476 --> 00:03:39.796
Oh, come on, come on.

00:03:40.156 --> 00:03:44.396
Is it really fair for me to hold
the X industry responsible

00:03:44.396 --> 00:03:47.196
for the environmental impact
of their clients?

00:03:47.876 --> 00:03:50.636
There is no official way
to do so just yet.

00:03:50.996 --> 00:03:54.676
We recognize only three scopes
of carbon emission.

00:03:54.996 --> 00:03:56.476
Scopes one and two:

00:03:56.476 --> 00:03:59.756
all the direct emissions
from your fleets and your factories

00:03:59.756 --> 00:04:01.356
and the power that you purchase.